+## Request 13: Vouchers (Completed)
+- Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` to src/invoices.js:
+  - Applies a fixed-amount voucher (in cents) to a draft invoice
+  - Stores voucher as `{ code, amount }` on invoice
+  - Validates status is 'draft' (error: NOT_DRAFT)
+  - Prevents duplicate vouchers (error: VOUCHER_EXISTS)
+  - Validates amount is positive integer (error: AMOUNT_INVALID)
+- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to include voucher in calculation:
+  - Returns { subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }
+  - total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher (clamped to 0)
+- Added error code:
+  - VOUCHER_EXISTS: "Invoice already has a voucher applied."
+- Added 8 new voucher tests covering:
+  - Applying voucher to draft invoice
+  - Voucher calculation in totals
+  - Preventing voucher on non-draft invoices
+  - Preventing duplicate vouchers
+  - Amount validation (positive integer)
+  - Voucher with discount and VAT
+  - No mutation of input invoice
+  - Default voucher (0) when none applied
+- All 149 tests pass (141 existing + 8 new voucher tests)
+
 ## Constraints Followed
 - Money stored as integer cents
 - Never throw; use fail() for errors
